{
  "metadata": {
    "name": "HN AI Report",
    "description": "Fetch top HN stories -> LLM filters for AI -> parallel fetch comments -> parallel LLM summarize -> final report."
  },
  "vertices": [
    {
      "id": "v_start",
      "initial_data": [
        {
          "channel": "default",
          "value": "trigger"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "v_stories"
    },
    {
      "id": "v_router"
    },
    {
      "id": "v_report",
      "script": "vertex/report_hook.py"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "e_fetch_stories",
      "source": "v_start",
      "destination": "v_stories",
      "channel": "default",
      "concurrency_type": "fetch",
      "script": "hn_edges.py:FetchTopStoriesEdge"
    },
    {
      "id": "e_filter",
      "source": "v_stories",
      "destination": "v_router",
      "channel": "default",
      "concurrency_type": "llm",
      "script": "hn_edges.py:FilterEdge",
      "settings": {
        "prompt": "这是一份 Hacker News 热帖列表(JSON 格式):\n{data}\n\n任务:选出与 AI、大语言模型、机器学习、深度学习相关的帖子,有多少选多少,不要限定数量。\n\n只输出一个合法的 JSON 数组,元素含 'id'、'title'、'url' 字段。不要解释,不要 markdown 格式。",
        "model": "hy3-free",
        "base_url": "https://opencode.ai/zen/v1/chat/completions",
        "proxy": "http://127.0.2.6:7890"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e_process_stories",
      "source": "v_router",
      "destination": "v_report",
      "channel": "default",
      "script": "hn_edges.py:ProcessStoriesMap",
      "settings": {
        "pipeline": [
          {
            "type": "fetch",
            "script": "hn_edges.py:FetchCommentsEdge",
            "settings": {
              "timeout": 30
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "llm",
            "script": "hn_edges.py:SummarizeEdge",
            "settings": {
              "prompt": "你是 Hacker News 上的 AI 话题观察员,把单帖讨论提炼成一份精炼的中文小结。\n\n## 工作约定\n\n1. **只输出正文**：一段 markdown，按【讨论要点】【技术细节】【社区观点】三个小节组织。\n2. **短而有信息量**：每小节用尽量少的要点讲清真实信息；宁可压缩/精简，也不要堆砌长句和注水。\n3. **忠于原文**：只写帖子里实际出现的内容(模型/工具/链接、具名用户、有效论点)；不确定的不写,不编造。\n4. **语言**：用中文,技术名词可保留英文。\n5. **不要重复标题和链接**,不要额外说明。",
              "model": "hy3-free",
              "base_url": "https://opencode.ai/zen/v1/chat/completions",
              "proxy": "http://127.0.2.6:7890"
            }
          }
        ],
        "max_concurrency": 5
      }
    }
  ]
}